    <section id="about" class="space-y-8 reveal">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Highly adaptable Full-Stack and GenAI Developer proficient in React, Django,
